{"name": "IN SILICO", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a distant future, humanity has been enslaved within a simulation. Now that you\u2019ve awakened, will you be able to escape reality as well?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beyond the simulation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up in an oppressive universe where you must escape from those who keep you in the simulation. Hide using the environment shadows and avoid the light of your enemies to avoid being caught!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/399dd5aae0408b6fd83f62c56e7f3f43.poster.avif?t=1781345863\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/399dd5aae0408b6fd83f62c56e7f3f43.webm?t=1781345863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/399dd5aae0408b6fd83f62c56e7f3f43.mp4?t=1781345863\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome the different sections that alternate gameplay between 2D and 3D modes where stealth, puzzles, platforms and action will be your tools to enjoy the cinematography, story and environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/f5e18b6567359848b40a293b3ff8770f.poster.avif?t=1781345863\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/f5e18b6567359848b40a293b3ff8770f.webm?t=1781345863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/f5e18b6567359848b40a293b3ff8770f.mp4?t=1781345863\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cinematic Experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IN SILICO blends a silhouette-based aesthetic with striking cinematic scenes, eye-catching visual effects, and animations driven by motion capture\u00a0that enhance the climactic moments of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/757e63cb3ac4b056661bbacc361bf388.poster.avif?t=1781345863\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/757e63cb3ac4b056661bbacc361bf388.webm?t=1781345863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/extras/757e63cb3ac4b056661bbacc361bf388.mp4?t=1781345863\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "In a distant future humanity is enslaved in a simulation. Now that you are awake, can you escape from reality too?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620520/596576ee23f28b74970e90d6cda58b990f9db7b7/header.jpg?t=1781345863", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Puzzle", "Stealth", "Horror", "Cinematic", "Action-Adventure"], "developers": "Gabriel Jim\u00e9nez Cabrera", "publishers": "Gabriel Jim\u00e9nez Cabrera", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3620520", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curat